    "text_full": "Thursday, May 21, 2026\nTRENDING\nTejasswi Prakash and Karan Kundrra Get Engaged! A Complete Relationship Timeline of TejRan’s Love Story From ‘Bigg Boss 15’ to Dream ProposalDaily Horoscope for May 21, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Cancer, Virgo, Taurus and MoreSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson BiopicMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?Seema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian CultureAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University SeriesJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes ViralDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and MoreJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First GlimpseJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\nEntertainment\nTV\nOTT\nMusic\nGlobal\nSports\nBollywood\nSouth\nHome\nEntertainment\nTV\n'Splitsvilla 16' Winners Are Gullu (Kushal Tanwar) And Kaira: Beat Yogesh-Ruru In Grand Finale, Win Rs 20 Lakh Prize Money\n'Splitsvilla 16' Winners Are Gullu (Kushal Tanwar) And Kaira: Beat Yogesh-Ruru In Grand Finale, Win Rs 20 Lakh Prize Money\nKushal Tanwar aka Gullu and Kaira won the ‘Splitsvilla 16’ trophy and Rs 20 lakh prize money in a dramatic grand finale hosted by Karan Kundrra and Sunny Leone.\nRishika SinghMay 16, 2026, 21:54 IST\n\nThe wait is finally over. Kushal Tanwar, better known as Gullu and his partner Kaira have been crowned the winners of MTV Splitsvilla Season 16, walking away with Rs 20 lakh prize money. The grand finale aired on May 16 on MTV India and JioHotstar and it delivered everything fans had been waiting for.\n\nThe night was not just about the task. Mischief Makers Uorfi Javed and Nia Sharma brought the Katghara segment to the stage, putting all four finalist couples face-to-face with allegations from ex-contestants. Tears, arguments and some very uncomfortable truths set the tone before a single race was even run.\n\nGullu and Kaira Crowned ‘Splitsvilla X6’ Winners\n\nThe result was decided by task performance and audience votes through 'Pyaar Ka Power', a first-of-its-kind twist that gave fans direct say in the final rankings. Kaira said after the win: \"Winning with Gullu feels unreal. We stayed strong through all the noise and knowing the audience chose us makes this even more special.\"\n\nHow the Couples Finished\n\n1st: Gullu and Kaira - Winners, Rs 20 lakh\n\n2nd: Yogesh Rawat and Ruru Thakur\n\n3rd: Sorab Bedi and Niharika Tiwari\n\n4th: Tayne De Villiers and Soundharya Shetty\n\nThe finale task was a multi-stage physical race involving a tower rescue, pot-breaking, a heart puzzle and a trust bridge. Four briefcases worth Rs 5 lakh each were placed across the course. Every couple was offered an early exit with Rs 5 lakh after collecting the fourth briefcase. Nobody took it.\n\nDrama That Stole the Show\n\nRuru Thakur broke down on stage after cheating allegations surfaced against Yogesh Rawat. Sorab and Niharika denied their own set of claims, and a heated argument between Soundharya and Deeptanshu Saini kept the drama going right till the end.\n\nSplitsvilla 16 signed off with a worthy pair of champions and a finale night nobody will forget quickly. Gullu and Kaira's journey through the season was not without its share of hurdles, but the couple held their ground every single time. The 'Pyaar Ka Power' twist made this win feel different because it was not just the villa that chose them, it was the audience. For a show that has always thrived on drama, love and the occasional chaos, Season 16 delivered on every front. Karan Kundrra and Sunny Leone signed off another electrifying season.\n\nTRENDING\n\nTejasswi Prakash and Karan Kundrra Get Engaged! A Complete Relationship Timeline of TejRan’s Love Story From ‘Bigg Boss 15’ to Dream Proposal\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 21, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Cancer, Virgo, Taurus and More\n\nSalman Khan News Today: Why the Bollywood Superstar Is Trending All Over Social Media!\n\n‘Michael’ Best Scenes: Jaafar Jackson Channels the ‘King of Pop’ Perfectly in Blockbuster Michael Jackson Biopic\n\nMouni Roy Brings Desi Royalty to Cannes 2026 in a Stunning Gujarati Patola Gown, See Pics\n\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n\nSeema Singh’s Cannes 2026 Appearance With Son Shrey Singh Is All About Grace, Glamour and Indian Culture\n\nAfter ‘Mortal Kombat II’, Get ‘Mortal Kombat 3’ Update: From Storyline to Cast, All You Need to Know\n\n'Dragon' Star Jr NTR Birthday: 5 Iconic Performances That Proved He is Tollywood’s True ‘Young Tiger’\n\n‘Off Campus’ Season 2 Release Date Announced? Everything To Know About the Returning Briar University Series\n\nJr NTR’s ‘Dragon’ Cast, Release Date and Plot Details: An Assassin, a Cop and a Deadly Showdown Await\n\n'India's Got Latent 2' Guest Rumours: Alia Bhatt, Sharvari on Samay Raina's Show? Leaked Image Goes Viral\n\nDaily Horoscope for May 20, 2026: What Today's Astrological Predictions Reveal for Scorpio, Aquarius, Aries and More\n\nJr NTR's Movie ‘Dragon’ Release Date: Prashanth Neel’s High-Octane Action Spectacle Unveils Powerful First Glimpse\n\nJacqueline Fernandez Turns Heads at Cannes 2026 Chopard Miracles Gala in Elegant Vintage-Inspired Black Dress\n\nRelated Articles\nTejasswi Prakash and Karan Kundrra Get Engaged! A Complete Relationship Timeline of TejRan’s Love Story From ‘Bigg Boss 15’ to Dream Proposal\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi 15’ Contestants Fees: Who Is Likely the Highest Paid Contestant on Rohit Shetty’s Show?\n‘India’s Best Dancer’ Season 5 Release Date Update: Here’s Everything To Know About Karisma Kapoor’s Dance Reality Show Return\n‘Khatron Ke Khiladi’ Season 15 Shooting Update: Rohit Shetty And Contestants Reach Cape Town, Here’s Everything To Know About The New Season\nTerms of use Privacy Policy\nCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved."
